{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shift At Midnight</i> is an online co-op horror game. You and up to 2 friends work the graveyard shift at a rural 90s gas station, though <strong>some of your customers aren't human.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTERROGATE YOUR CUSTOMERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722330/extras/9f1a9318459c9fda916c6b9cd7335ed8.poster.avif?t=1766678946\" width=398 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722330/extras/9f1a9318459c9fda916c6b9cd7335ed8.webm?t=1766678946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722330/extras/9f1a9318459c9fda916c6b9cd7335ed8.mp4?t=1766678946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure out if your customers are doppelgangers. Examine their ID, cross-check their details in the computer, and observe their behavior. One slip-up might expose a creature\u2026 or cost you your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BOARD UP, LAY TRAPS AND HIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722330/extras/684be97adde58cddd4413f87878cb789.poster.avif?t=1766678946\" width=398 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722330/extras/684be97adde58cddd4413f87878cb789.webm?t=1766678946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722330/extras/684be97adde58cddd4413f87878cb789.mp4?t=1766678946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a creature manages to leave the store, all hell breaks loose. Barricade the doors, place traps, and find a place to hide. Survival is no longer guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BETTER WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift at Midnight is best played with friends: invite up to 2 others via Steam for private co-op sessions. Or brave the night alone if you dare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST TO SUPPORT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shift at Midnight</i> is well into development, and we're working hard to make it the most hilarious and terrifying co-op horror experience you can share with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you'd like to support the project, the best thing you can do is <strong>wishlist the game on Steam</strong>. It\u2019s completely free, takes just a second, and makes a huge difference in helping us reach more players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FREE DEMO AVAILABLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free <strong>SINGLEPLAYER demo is available right now on Itch.io</strong> for you to experience the tense horror of <i>Shift at Midnight</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722330?t=1766678946","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722330/f4ffde79fa09cebf80d6e5e0631762747f045c8c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766678946","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722330/f052dd3af5e0343ba7bc6dbcccff5ed9dfdafa6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766678946","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722330/f052dd3af5e0343ba7bc6dbcccff5ed9dfdafa6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766678946","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":